Penguin sprite pack provenance

Author/origin: OpenAI image generation tool, requested by the Dropdown Terminal
maintainer on 2026-09-05. The sprite atlas and compact bar icon were generated
as original artwork for this repository; no third-party artwork was imported.

Modifications: pet.png was normalized to a 256x256 RGBA PNG (8 columns by 8
rows of 32x32 cells) with nearest-neighbor scaling and metadata stripped.
bar.png was normalized to a separate 20x20 RGBA PNG with nearest-neighbor
scaling. For Phase 6, hang cells 7, 60, and 61 were authored from the pack's
existing pixel-art frames with a 180-degree transform; all other atlas cells
remain unchanged. The action/frame mapping and contact anchors are authored in
pet.json.

Prompt summary: original cute black-and-white penguin pixel-art sprite atlas
and separate compact bar icon, transparent background, limited palette, hard
integer-aligned edges, no text or watermark.

